# v1.4.0 (security audit C2) — this file did not exist, and that was a
# loaded gun. `wrangler dev` reads local secrets from worker/.dev.vars, and
# with nothing ignoring it, one `git add .` would have committed the shop's
# ADMIN_KEY, BRIDGE_KEY and Billplz keys into the repository's permanent
# history. tests/no-secrets.mjs catches known key SHAPES, not an arbitrary
# passcode — so the test was never going to save us here.
#
# Mirrors the portal repo's ignore list.

# Secrets — never, under any circumstances
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.dev.vars.example
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# Build output
node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
.wrangler/
.vercel/

# Local noise
deploy-log.txt
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# --- v1.46.3: the Windows duplicates the 08-09 audit found on disk --------
# worker/src/index-1.ts and index-2.ts are copies Windows made when it could
# not overwrite the original. worker/tsconfig.json already excludes these
# names from the compile gate; this keeps them out of the repository too.
*-1.ts
*-2.ts
*-3.ts
*-1.tsx
*-2.tsx
*-1.js
*-2.js
*-1.json
*-2.json
*-1.md
*-2.md
